{"type":"message","id":"685564d4","parentId":"a807fd1b","timestamp":"2026-05-18T05:32:35.479Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the root endpoint returns Unauthorized without API key. The issue is with the /send endpoint returning 1101. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error code. Error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw Exception\" or a custom error.\n\nLet me try checking if maybe the POST needs different content-type, or maybe the format of the request body is wrong. Let me try with --data-raw.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d4de8540-3134-4e5f-b611-0bb0dccde865","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with --data-raw and explicit content type\ncurl -s -X POST 'https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send' \\\n  -H 'X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 05:30 UTC\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19892,"output":197,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20201,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779082348424,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e12e3372-d930-4912-b6cb-187d3f378a93"}}
