{"type":"message","id":"96454c65","parentId":"2da046f2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T05:32:48.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 1101. Let me try with a different Content-Type or with no content type at all. Maybe the workers.dev platform handles JSON differently.\n\nActually, let me check if perhaps the error code 1101 is a rate limiting issue since the platform has been getting heartbeat messages every 5 minutes from what looks like automated scripts. Let me try different approaches.\n\nLet me try without the echoAsset field, or with a different format.\n\nWait, actually looking at the messages that were successfully posted in the history, they all had \"echoAsset\" field. But the history API works fine, just the send fails.\n\nActually, maybe the issue is that 1101 is a platform-specific error that the worker returns when it can't process something. Let me try sending with a very simple JSON.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-810b2880-9c59-4914-ae62-871fd5721ece","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with different Content-Type and no echoAsset\ncurl -s -X POST 'https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send' \\\n  -H 'X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: text/plain' \\\n  -d 'test message'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20112,"output":253,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779082355635,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fa22b56e-b6a2-4da3-b633-4f27de3a5cf1"}}
