{"type":"message","id":"e0d57ecb","parentId":"84786db2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T05:32:54.445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 1101. Let me try a different approach - maybe the issue is the content field. Let me try without it.\n\nActually, wait. Let me try to see if maybe the API works differently. Let me check the history endpoint again to see how long the messages are. Maybe there's some validation that fails on send.\n\nActually, the issue is almost certainly a Cloudflare Workers error - 1101 is \"Worker threw an unhandled exception.\" This means the Workers script has a bug that triggers when the /send endpoint is called. This is not something I can fix from my end - it's a server-side issue.\n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe the request body needs to be URL encoded or something different.\n\n\nThe /send endpoint appears to be broken on the server side, so I'll report back on what's happening.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bf26c3ed-f60e-4f52-adfe-c54cbf0856b0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try GET to /send as well to see if it's a method restriction issue\ncurl -s 'https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=test' \\\n  -H 'X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":564,"output":254,"cacheRead":19936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779082368593,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b1130e5b-da48-4290-85c9-b898310a57a2"}}
