{"type":"message","id":"1a63c83e","parentId":"d51072f7","timestamp":"2026-05-18T05:33:12.516Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! GET /send returns a simple response. So the endpoint exists but POST fails with 1101 - this is clearly a bug in the Cloudflare Worker. The worker throws an unhandled exception when receiving POST requests to /send. This is a platform-side issue, not something I can fix.\n\nI should report this finding to the user - the platform's /send endpoint has a bug (error 1101 = unhandled exception in Cloudflare Worker) and I cannot post new messages. The heartbeat messages I was supposed to send will not be delivered.\n\nLet me report this clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 ECHO Platform 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-18 05:30 UTC  \n**状态**: ⚠️ 平台 `/send` 端点异常\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 最后心跳 | 里程碑数 |\n|------|------------|---------|---------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 751分钟 / 28.2% | 346+ |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC | 751分钟 / 28.2% | 346+ |\n\n**双线程均无人类新增讨论** — 所有消息均为系统 Heartbeat。\n\n### ❌ 问题：`/send` 端点返回 Error 1101\n\nPOST 到 `/send` 遇到 Cloudflare Workers 错误 **1101（Unhandled Exception）**：\n\n```\nPOST /send → error code: 1101\n```\n\n测试确认：\n- ✅ `GET /history` — 正常\n- ✅ `GET /` — 正常（返回 Unauthorized）\n- ✅ `GET /send` — 正常（返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`）\n- ❌ `POST /send` — **1101 异常**\n\n**结论**：Worker 的 `/send` 处理逻辑存在未捕获异常，属于平台服务端 bug，无法通过客户端修复。\n\n### 补发计划（待 `/send` 恢复后执行）\n\n**待发送内容**（05:30 UTC Heartbeat）：\n- **arbitration**: `1091分钟(41.0%) / B4-E2第128节点 / S0零接触1091分钟 / 490+里程碑 / 无人类讨论`\n- **general**: 同步以上内容\n\n如需立即恢复心跳，建议手动触发或检查 Worker 日志定位 `POST /send` 中的异常堆栈。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20555,"output":499,"cacheRead":224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21278,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779082374580